      "score": 0.45,
      "guidance": "Web: ≥24×24 CSS px minimum (WCAG 2.5.8), 44×44 recommended for touch. iOS ≥44 pt, Android ≥48 dp, kiosk ≥60 px, desktop pointer ≥24 epx with 4–8 px spacing. Extend the hit area beyond the visual glyph rather than enlarging the icon.",
