      "score": 0.243,
      "guidance": "A geometric-ish scale (4/8/12/16/24/32/48/64), inside-group spacing smaller than between-group spacing (ratio ≥1.5×), alignment to a grid, consistent inset per container type, optical alignment for icons and text baselines. Inconsistent spacing is the most common 'unprofessional' signal.",
      "use_when": "Every layout decision; every 'spacing feels off' complaint.",
